  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the donabe over medium heat.",
    "Add sesame oil and swirl to coat the bottom.",
    "Stir in cumin seeds until they begin to crackle.",
    "Add ground coriander, cardamom, and turmeric and sauté for 30 seconds.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and vegetable broth, then stir in tamarind paste.",
    "Bring the mixture to a gentle simmer while covering the donabe.",
    "Add the mussels and candied orange peel, then simmer until the mussels open, about 6 minutes.",
    "Season with salt, remove from heat, garnish with fresh coriander, and serve hot directly from the donabe."
  ],
